{'symbol': 'APA', 'date': '2022-02-28 16:15:00', 'title': "APA CORPORATION NAMED TO FORBES LIST OF AMERICA'S BEST MIDSIZE EMPLOYERS FOR 2022", 'text': "HOUSTON, FEB. 28, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- APA CORPORATION (NASDAQ: APA) HAS BEEN NAMED TO FORBES' 2022 LIST OF AMERICA'S BEST MIDSIZE EMPLOYERS FOR THE SECOND YEAR IN A ROW. THE FINAL LIST SPANS 25 INDUSTRIES, RECOGNIZING THE TOP 500 COMPANIES THAT RECEIVED THE MOST RECOMMENDATIONS FROM THEIR EMPLOYEES."}